{"id":"NCT06427304","title":"Cardiac Amyloidosis pRevaleNce of in OLDer Subjects Affected by Heart Failure","official":"Cardiac Amyloidosis pRevaleNce of in OLDer Subjects Affected by Heart Failure","summary":"Tne aim purpose of this observational, multicentre and propective study is to determine the prevalence of cardiac amyloidosis in geriatric patients aged 80 years and older hospitalized within the last 12 months for heart failure with left ventricular hypertrophy (septum ≥ 12 mm) on echocardiography","conditions":["Cardiac Amyloidosis"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Aged ≥ 80 years\n* Hospitalised for decompensation of heart failure in the last 12 months\n* Subjects with hypertrophy of the septum or left ventricle at cardiac echography (defined as ≥ 12 mm)\n* Subjects able to undergo a bone scintigraphy scan\n* Subjects willing to participate\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Subjects refusing to participate\n* Subjects admitted to palliative care unit.\n* Subjects under guardianship\n* Subjects with a definite diagnosis of cardiac amyloidosis","minAge":"80 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":637,"start":"2024-07-01","pcd":"2027-07-02","upd":"2026-04-20","sponsor":"Gérond'if","areas":["neurology","rare"],"central":["Isabelle Dufour · +33 (0) 185781011 · isabelle.dufour@gerondif.org","Prisca Lucas, MPH PhD · +33 (0)185737323 · prisca.lucas@gerondif.org"],"sites":[{"f":"Geriatric Department, Broca Hospital","city":"Paris","pr":"","zip":"75013","s":"R","lat":48.8534,"lon":2.3488,"c":"Olivier Hanon, MD PhD · +33 (0)144083503 · olivier.hanon@aphp.fr"},{"f":"CHU Nantes","city":"Nantes","pr":"","zip":"44000","s":"R","lat":47.2172,"lon":-1.5534,"c":"Anne Sophie BOUREAU, MD"},{"f":"CHU Poitiers","city":"Poitiers","pr":"","zip":"86000","s":"R","lat":46.5826,"lon":0.3435,"c":"Marc PACCALIN, MD, PHD"},{"f":"CHU Rouen, Charles Nicole hospital","city":"Rouen","pr":"","zip":"76000","s":"R","l